Package: revpiper
Title: Systematic Review Data Processing and Presentation Pipelines
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Liz", "Spry", , "liz.spry@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Takes systematic review teams from extracted data to
    manuscript-ready tables and figures through user-authored
    specifications: a data dictionary describing their extraction files,
    declared assembly and automated cleaning, audited manual corrections,
    and a tiered, re-runnable derivation layer.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/lizspry/revpiper
BugReports: https://github.com/lizspry/revpiper/issues
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 8.0.0
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/testthat/parallel: true
Imports:
    cli,
    rlang (>= 1.3.0),
    tibble,
    writexl,
    yaml
